      "snippet": " page in other languages: Russian\n\nIt\u2019s been nearly two years since researchers from Google, Stanford, UC Berkeley, and OpenAI released the paper, \u201cConcrete Problems in AI Safety,\u201d yet it\u2019s still one of the most important pieces on AI safety. Eve"
